  "title": "PVP Utilities",
  "description": "All the things you'll need for a nice PvP experience and look",
  "body": "If you want many nice PVP features, while keeping the vanilla look (or just as an overlay), this pack will be perfect for you!\n\n![Image that shows a title with the name of the pack](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b3efa7ffd0458d0e71066c9d0561e0164c834196.png)\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/pvputilities\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_64h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://x.com/cr3lay\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/cozy/social/twitter-singular_64h.png\" alt=\"Twitter\"></a> <a href=\"https://guns.lol/crelay\"><img src=\"https://images.guns.lol/1cdda87505111e7d02bc14dd6434d41bd00bdb1e/Z7q57F.png\" alt=\"socials\"></a> \n\n\n## Features \n- Smaller Utils\n- Small Totem Pop\n- Better Shield Sound \n- 3d Crystal\n- No Pumpkin Overlay\n- Side Shield\n- No Eating Particle\n- No Nausea Effect\n- No Vignette\n- No Explosion Particle\n- No Water Overlay\n- No Fire Overlay\n\n\n\n<details>\n<summary>Credits</summary>\n\n3d End Crystal Texture by asvjp2 (deleted his reddit) [from this pack](https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/3d-end-crystals)\n\nBetter Shield Sound by [DangerMario](https://youtube.com/@Marlowww)\n\n\n\n</details>\n\n",
